        <ownedLogicalComponents xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.la:LogicalComponent"
            id="05749cb4-9371-47fc-8d19-2ca889129742" name="Industrial PC" description="&lt;title>&lt;/title>&#xA;&lt;p>Industrial PC&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>An Industrial PC (IPC) is a computer specifically designed and built to operate reliably in industrial environments, where conditions may be harsh, such as extreme temperatures, dust, humidity, and vibration. These PCs are used in a wide range of industries, including manufacturing, oil and gas, transportation, automation, and more.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>Industrial PCs are built with robust components and are designed to withstand the demanding conditions of industrial settings. They are typically housed in rugged enclosures that offer protection against dust, water, and other contaminants. Some industrial PCs are also equipped with features like shock resistance and fanless cooling systems to ensure optimal performance and longevity in challenging environments.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>In addition to their durability, industrial PCs are known for their high reliability and long lifespan. They are often engineered with redundant components and power supplies to minimize the risk of system failure and downtime. Industrial PCs also offer a variety of expansion options and support for specialized industrial interfaces, such as serial ports, GPIO (General Purpose Input/Output), and industrial protocols like Modbus.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>These PCs are used for a wide range of industrial applications, including process control, data acquisition, machine monitoring, HMI (Human-Machine Interface), industrial automation, and more. They provide the computing power necessary to perform complex tasks in demanding environments without compromising on performance or reliability.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>References:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>&amp;quot;What Is an Industrial PC?&amp;quot; - Nexcom&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>&amp;quot;Industrial PC for Tough Environments&amp;quot; - Advantech&lt;/p>&#xA;"
            appliedPropertyValueGroups="#f248c3dd-721e-4a33-80aa-f38ffd6903e6 #c6874923-459a-4aab-8091-2b6f4ae994ed"
            status="#63416077-7eff-455e-8d6e-2bf85006a695">
          <ownedExtensions xsi:type="smw:TcItemRevision" id="826d7999-b7dd-431b-be43-dde7950ff313"
              tcuid="jmsVns8_4nxmPD" stableTcId="DykVns8_4nxmPD" itemId="096065" revisionId="A"/>
